eckpoint indicates if this is the first checkpoint of the session\n   135→\t// When true, all working directory files are captured (not just modified)\n   136→\tIsFirstCheckpoint bool\n   137→}\n   138→\n   139→// ReadTemporaryResult contains the result of reading a temporary checkpoint.\n   140→type ReadTemporaryResult struct {\n   141→\t// CommitHash is the hash of the checkpoint commit\n   142→\tCommitHash plumbing.Hash\n   143→\n   144→\t// TreeHash is the hash of the tree containing the checkpoint state\n   145→\tTreeHash plumbing.Hash\n   146→\n   147→\t// SessionID is the session identifier from the commit trailer\n   148→\tSessionID string\n   149→\n   150→\t// MetadataDir is the metadata directory path from the commit trailer\n   151→\tMetadataDir string\n   152→\n   153→\t// Timestamp is when the checkpoint was created\n   154→\tTimestamp time.Time\n   155→}\n   156→\n   157→// TemporaryInfo contains summary information about a shadow branch.\n   158→type TemporaryInfo struct {\n   159→\t// BranchName is the full branch name (e.g., \"entire/abc1234\")\n   160→\tBranchName string\n   161→\n   162→\t// BaseCommit is the short commit hash this branch is based on\n   163→\tBaseCommit string\n   164→\n   165→\t// LatestCommit is the hash of the latest commit on the branch\n   166→\tLatestCommit plumbing.Hash\n   167→\n   168→\t// SessionID is the session identifier from the latest commit\n   169→\tSessionID string\n   170→\n   171→\t// Timestamp is when the latest checkpoint was created\n   172→\tTimestamp time.Time\n   173→}\n   174→\n   175→// WriteCommittedOptions contains options for writing a committed checkpoint.\n   176→type WriteCommittedOptions struct {\n   177→\t// CheckpointID is the stable 12-hex-char identifier\n   178→\tCheckpointID string\n   179→\n   180→\t// SessionID is the session identifier\n   181→\tSessionID string\n   182→\n   183→\t// Strategy is the name of the strategy that created this checkpoint\n   184→\tStrategy string\n   185→\n  