ion:** This works correctly for multi-session checkpoints, but:\n1. Not explicitly tested\n2. No documentation of this behavior\n3. Fragile to future schema changes\n\n---\n\n## Summary and Recommendations\n\n### Verdict: REQUEST CHANGES\n\nThe implementation is **functionally correct** and handles the main use case well, but has **three critical issues** that should be addressed before merging:\n\n1. **Implicit metadata field preservation** - make explicit which fields are preserved\n2. **Empty summary saving** - skip commit if summary is empty\n3. **Undocumented race condition** - at minimum add a comment about concurrency safety\n\n### Must Fix Before Merge\n1. Add explicit comment documenting metadata field preservation strategy\n2. Add validation to skip saving empty summaries\n3. Add concurrency safety note or implement conflict detection\n\n### Should Fix\n1. Add tests for multi-session checkpoints and all metadata fields\n2. Review .gitignore change (questionable to block docs/requirements/)\n3. Enhance commit message with summary details\n4. Add field-level documentation to UpdateSummaryOptions\n\n### Nice to Have\n1. Better documentation of best-effort semantics\n2. Consider exposing empty summary detection as public helper for testing\n\n### Estimated Effort\n- Critical fixes: ~30 minutes (comments + validation + tests)\n- Should fix: ~40 minutes (tests + docs + cleanup)\n- Nice to have: ~15 minutes\n\n**Total to approve: ~70 minutes**\n\n---\n\n## Files Changed in Commit 42c50f6\n\n| File | Changes |\n|------|---------|\n| `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/checkpoint.go` | +UpdateSummary interface method, +UpdateSummaryOptions struct |\n| `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/committed.go` | +UpdateSummary implementation (71 lines) |\n| `cmd/entire/cli/explain.go` | +saveSummaryToCheckpoint() helper, wired to --generate flow |\n| `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/checkpoint_test.go` | +TestUpdateSummary, +TestUpdateSummary_CheckpointNotFound |\n| `.gitignore` | +docs/requirement